{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/frameworks/layout,_N_T_/frameworks/page,_N_T_/frameworks"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--3_YsJYZWrodYXcBUxiXYU--><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/0081af9fd4fec0e1.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/77601ebe1fbe3da2.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-5c5613942f47120d.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-c023c6e3521b1417.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/255-3d881dfa8c72bc56.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-60b53674f5a8114a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-6a8cee1febeac4c4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/619-ba102abea3e3d0e4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/874-1ba6df67fefa8f44.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/frameworks/page-1b3a2a496c1b165f.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Anupam Sarkar — Designing where AI is the material</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Portfolio of Anupam Sarkar. Senior product designer building AI-native products. The interface is the agent.\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Anupam Sarkar — AI-native product design\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The interface is the agent. Twelve years of work.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Anupam Sarkar — AI-native product design\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"The interface is the agent. Twelve years of work.\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><canvas aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;mix-blend-mode:screen\"></canvas><div class=\"grid-overlay\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><nav class=\"Nav_nav__o8sSc\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Nav_row__TbWky\"><a class=\"Nav_brand__vMusG\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"Nav_dot__Z8Jyv\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"Nav_brandText__Rf0lb\">Anupam <span class=\"serif-italic\">Sarkar</span></span></a><div class=\"Nav_links__8Axcs\"><a class=\"Nav_link__AQMuy\" href=\"/\">Work</a><a class=\"Nav_link__AQMuy\" href=\"/frameworks\">Frameworks</a><a class=\"Nav_link__AQMuy\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"Nav_linkAccent__UnO49\" href=\"/contact\">Contact ↗</a></div></div></div></nav><main class=\"container\" style=\"padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px\"><header class=\"SectionHeader_head__devBj\"><div class=\"SectionHeader_left__GzYRf\"><div class=\"SectionHeader_label__Yb_G8\">// <!-- -->frameworks</div><h2 class=\"SectionHeader_title__vyeYC\">Two frameworks. <em>Both in active use.</em></h2></div><div class=\"SectionHeader_right__lYeFz\"></div></header><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-bottom:80px\"><a class=\"FrameworkCard_card__kxkfv\" href=\"#ifu\"><div class=\"FrameworkCard_tag__OVPqz\">IFU · intent-first ux</div><h3 class=\"FrameworkCard_title__fMxdx\">A <em>four-stage</em> spine for AI interfaces</h3><p class=\"FrameworkCard_desc__qZe9P\">Sense, Morph, Confirm, Escape — the four moves an AI interface must make for the visitor to extend it agency.</p><ol class=\"FrameworkCard_stages__qmlf4\"><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->1</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Sense</span></li><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->2</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Morph</span></li><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->3</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Confirm</span></li><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->4</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Escape</span></li></ol><div class=\"FrameworkCard_cta__H6Ai0\">Read the framework →</div></a><a class=\"FrameworkCard_card__kxkfv\" href=\"#gravity\"><div class=\"FrameworkCard_tag__OVPqz\">GRAVITY · spatial</div><h3 class=\"FrameworkCard_title__fMxdx\"><em>Four planes</em> for embodied AI</h3><p class=\"FrameworkCard_desc__qZe9P\">Ground, Ring, Atmosphere, Voice — a model for designing agents that live in space, not in rectangles.</p><ol class=\"FrameworkCard_stages__qmlf4\"><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->1</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Ground</span></li><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->2</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Ring</span></li><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->3</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Atmosphere</span></li><li class=\"FrameworkCard_stage__HAFWE\"><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageNum__aisEE\">0<!-- -->4</span><span class=\"FrameworkCard_stageLabel__GbqwR\">Voice</span></li></ol><div class=\"FrameworkCard_cta__H6Ai0\">Read the framework →</div></a></div><div id=\"ifu\" style=\"padding-top:60px\"><header class=\"SectionHeader_head__devBj\"><div class=\"SectionHeader_left__GzYRf\"><div class=\"SectionHeader_label__Yb_G8\">// <!-- -->critique surface</div><h2 class=\"SectionHeader_title__vyeYC\">Drop a screenshot. <em>Get scored.</em></h2></div><div class=\"SectionHeader_right__lYeFz\"><div class=\"SectionHeader_meta__c8WRO\">ifu · sense · morph · confirm · escape</div></div></header><div style=\"border:1px dashed var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;padding:60px;text-align:center;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;align-items:center;background:rgba(10, 13, 20, 0.4)\"><div style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:var(--t-meta-s);letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--neon)\">Critique Surface · stub</div><p style=\"font-family:var(--display);font-weight:300;font-size:24px;color:var(--ink);max-width:520px\">Wire this to a Claude vision endpoint. Visitor uploads a screenshot; the agent returns four IFU scores, three issues, and one fix.</p></div></div></main><footer class=\"FooterCTA_footer__Ixqe_\" data-narrate=\"footer\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"FooterCTA_grid__lUIv3\"><div class=\"FooterCTA_left__6mMWK\"><div class=\"FooterCTA_kicker__bGOAy\">// closing</div><h2 class=\"FooterCTA_title__IVNFn\">You&#x27;ve read this far.<br/><span class=\"serif-italic\">Let&#x27;s talk.</span></h2><p class=\"FooterCTA_sub__SMCHf\">I&#x27;m interviewing for Design Director and AI Product Design Lead roles in 2026. I prefer async-first conversation that gets concrete fast.</p></div><div class=\"FooterCTA_right__b4FDk\"><button class=\"FooterCTA_primary__JPu79\">Book a 30-min call →</button><a class=\"FooterCTA_btn__g__wU\" href=\"#\">Download case deck (PDF)</a><a class=\"FooterCTA_btn__g__wU\" href=\"mailto:ar.anupamsarkar@gmail.com\">ar.anupamsarkar@gmail.com</a><a class=\"FooterCTA_btn__g__wU\" href=\"https://linkedin.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">LinkedIn ↗</a></div></div><div class=\"FooterCTA_meta__zUBAe\"><span>© 2026 Anupam Sarkar</span><span>built · v0.1 · agent-native</span><span>The agent is the form.</span></div></div></footer><!--$--><!--/$--><aside class=\"AgentStatusRail_rail__PSUPd\" aria-label=\"Agent status — Chitra\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><header class=\"AgentStatusRail_head__ASvL_\"><div class=\"AgentStatu